abstract: >-
  Bilingual (French / English) open dataset of Congolese recipes from the
  Democratic Republic of the Congo, curated for Mpichi. Intended for culinary
  research, NLP, and local LLM fine-tuning. Text under CC BY 4.0; scripts under MIT.
